{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Therefore he shall lie with you tonight</b> — therefore she was not buried with him in the cave." "<b>Therefore</b> in gematria is מדה במדה (measure for measure). In Levi it is written כי ילדתי לו (that I have borne him) 3, and in Zebulun it is written כי ילדתי לו 6. When she bore 3, she said: I have borne 3, which are my portion. And when she bore another 3, she said: I have borne 6, two portions."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:26.188801178Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}